# Tests

- Put unit tests in that module’s `__tests__/` folder, not beside source.
- Include: `src/**/__tests__/**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}`.
- Keep the 100% coverage gate. Exclude barrels, bootstrap, and `src/shared/test`.
- Use `src/shared/test/render.tsx` for app chrome. Reset token/session stores in `afterEach`.
